  "content": "\n\n<p>此模组添加了原版 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Avaritia</a> 的所有内容。更多信息请查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fftbwiki.org%252fAvaritia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Wiki</a>。</p>\n<p>本模组为<strong>非官方</strong>版本，且存在错误！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">本模组的ID与原版模组不同。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>其他 Avaritia 版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-1-10\" rel=\"nofollow\">Avaritia (1.1x)&nbsp;</a>由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/brandon3055\" rel=\"nofollow\">brandon3055</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Avaritia (旧版)&nbsp;</a>由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/spiteful_fox\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spiteful_Fox</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">Avaritia Continued (衍生版)</a>&nbsp;由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/ocle_42/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocle_42</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/re-avaritia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Re:Avaritia</a> 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cnlimiter/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cnlimiter</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>支持的模组语言：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>英文（源自原版模组）</li>\n<li>俄文（感谢 SKEPLORSIK）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以将此模组用于您的整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组仅添加原版 Avaritia 的内容！如需新特性，请使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-lite-extended\" rel=\"nofollow\">Avaritia Lite Extended</a>！</p>",
